    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Tier 3 — Storm Wardens</strong></p><p><strong>“Weather is only random if nobody is in charge.”</strong></p><p>Storm Wardens treat wind, flood, ashfall, and static like administrative problems. They know how to ride a storm front, ground a lightning field, and keep a faction moving when the world is trying to turn travel into a funeral.</p><p><em>You’ve learned to hear danger in the air before it becomes visible.</em></p><ul><li><strong>Tactical:</strong> You reroll the lowest die on checks made to predict hazardous weather, navigate storms, resist environmental contamination, or stabilize people and equipment under severe conditions.</li><li><strong>Strategic:</strong> Your faction more reliably detects incoming environmental threats and corruption-weather events.</li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
